    "name": "Heroic Aegisio: Origins",
    "steam_appid": 3675930,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Tower! Build! Build!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face mysterious enemies and clash with supreme bosses \u2013 prove you're the ultimate commander! Build powerful towers, trigger synergies, and equip them wisely to achieve victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Epic of Towers and Skills</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 mighty Realms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 unique towers, each with their own skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 40 powerful synergies that unlock strategic combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tower power is ranked by Tier: Bronze \u2013 Silver \u2013 Gold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and utilize over 100 items to execute your strategy.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Choice, Your Strategy</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty levels and game modes to conquer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless waves of escalating challenges to test your leadership.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and build synergistic towers from scratch to gain the upper hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate and coordinate with teammates to perfect your defense.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Team Up for Victory</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade</strong>: Support teammates by sharing resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tower Sharing</strong>: Complete your team's formation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Item Storage</strong>: Share and retrieve ideal equipment for your towers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Positioning</strong>: Be the anchor your team can rely on.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game History</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heroic Aegiso: Origins</strong> is a remake of the legendary Warcraft III mod, <i>Heroic Origins: Galaxy</i>. Continuously upgraded and rebalanced through many seasons, the game now returns with a brand-new, refined experience.<br>If you love strategy, tower defense, and cooperative gameplay \u2014 <strong>Heroic Aegiso: Origins</strong> is the perfect battlefield to put your skills to the test!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Tower! Build! Build!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face mysterious enemies and clash with supreme bosses \u2013 prove you're the ultimate commander! Build powerful towers, trigger synergies, and equip them wisely to achieve victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Epic of Towers and Skills</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 mighty Realms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 unique towers, each with their own skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 40 powerful synergies that unlock strategic combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tower power is ranked by Tier: Bronze \u2013 Silver \u2013 Gold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and utilize over 100 items to execute your strategy.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Choice, Your Strategy</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty levels and game modes to conquer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless waves of escalating challenges to test your leadership.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and build synergistic towers from scratch to gain the upper hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate and coordinate with teammates to perfect your defense.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Team Up for Victory</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade</strong>: Support teammates by sharing resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tower Sharing</strong>: Complete your team's formation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Item Storage</strong>: Share and retrieve ideal equipment for your towers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Positioning</strong>: Be the anchor your team can rely on.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game History</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heroic Aegiso: Origins</strong> is a remake of the legendary Warcraft III mod, <i>Heroic Origins: Galaxy</i>. Continuously upgraded and rebalanced through many seasons, the game now returns with a brand-new, refined experience.<br>If you love strategy, tower defense, and cooperative gameplay \u2014 <strong>Heroic Aegiso: Origins</strong> is the perfect battlefield to put your skills to the test!</p>",
    "short_description": "A strategic multiplayer tower defense game where players build synergistic towers, trade resources, and coordinate with teammates to overcome challenging enemy waves.",
